:: Start
<<set $gameStarted = false>>
Welcome to Sons of Ordson, a text-based game set in the world of Gerajyo. It is still very early in development, so don't expect a complete game yet.

For suggestions or concerns, feel free to open an issue on GitHub: https://github.com/danielbarnes175/SonsOfOrdson/issues

[[Start Your Adventure|Character Creation]]

:: Character Creation
You are a Son of Ordson. You've lived here your whole life, and it is a city you've loved and hated at different times. Despite those mixed experiences, you still call Ordson home.

Before you set out for the day, you take a look in the mirror.

<<set $age = 20>>\
You see a <<numberinput "$player.age" $player.age 13 65>>-year-old man looking back. You see someone worthy of the name <<textbox "$player.name" $player.name>>.

<hr>
You think back to your life and the strengths and weaknesses that you've developed.
<<nobr>>
<<if !$characterCreationInitialized>>
    <<set $characterCreationInitialized = true>>
    <<set $statPool = 27>>
    <<getStarterEquipment>>
<</if>>
<</nobr>>
<<pointbuy "$player.stats" "$statPool" 27>>

[[Confirm|In Your Room]]

:: Player Avatar
<<playerAvatar>>\
